{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this playable slice of <i>Kamikaze Strike: FPV Drone</i>, you'll embark on two intense operations that showcase the essence of drone warfare. Each mission drops you behind enemy lines with one goal: fly fast, stay hidden, and deliver destruction with surgical precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036490/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.poster.avif?t=1759258386\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036490/extras/71bb8a021f9adf6e4a922807a6444b54.webm?t=1759258386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through dense electronic warfare, dodge enemy fire, and unleash controlled chaos as you pilot explosive-laden drones in fully immersive FPV mode. From narrow canyon runs to high-altitude assaults, every second counts\u2014and every mistake has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the core mechanics, physics, and adrenaline-pumping combat that define Kamikaze Strike. Two missions. Two chances to prove your skills. Many more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036490/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.poster.avif?t=1759258386\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036490/extras/08adb80be2b12eccc76be65b55ecf8e2.webm?t=1759258386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageback